              ],
              "solution": "$2021 \\equiv 5 [6] \\Rightarrow 2021^{2n} \\equiv 5^{2n} \\equiv 1 [6]$.\n$1441 \\equiv 1 [6] \\Rightarrow 1441^n \\equiv 1^n \\equiv 1 [6]$.\n$4^{2n+1} \\equiv 4 [6]$ (لأن $4^k \\equiv 4 [6]$ لـ $k \\ge 1$).\nالمجموع $\\equiv 1 + 1 + 4 = 6 \\equiv 0 [6]$.",
              "ordering": 4,
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "j6e7f8g9-h0i1-4j2a-3b4c-5d6e7f8g9h0i",
