              "depends_on": [],
              "solution": "من أجل $n=0$: $u_0=1$ و $0 < 1 < 2$ محققة. نفرض $0 < u_n < 2 \\Rightarrow 0 < u_n^2 < 4 \\Rightarrow 0 < \\frac{1}{2}u_n^2 < 2 \\Rightarrow 2 < 2 + \\frac{1}{2}u_n^2 < 4 \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{2} < u_{n+1} < 2$. إذن $0 < u_{n+1} < 2$.",
